WEBVTT

00:29.012 --> 00:33.616
Shadows lengthen on the wall The sequence has

00:33.696 --> 00:38.379
begun A chill is blowing through the hall

00:39.560 --> 00:44.684
Awakening the sun We read the signs in broken

00:44.825 --> 00:51.190
glass And traced the hidden lines Another empty

00:51.250 --> 00:57.700
day will pass Another fate declines The gears

00:57.720 --> 01:03.324
are turning in the dark Above the factory floor

01:04.345 --> 01:09.588
We try to catch the fading spark Behind the heavy

01:09.668 --> 01:16.493
dark Can you see the prophecy unfold? It's

01:16.653 --> 01:22.397
unfolding Shadows in the stories we were told

01:25.863 --> 01:26.544
A prophecy unfolds

01:46.724 --> 01:51.728
A thousand voices in the wire A whisper in the

01:51.848 --> 01:58.112
screen We feed the papers to the fire To keep the

01:58.272 --> 02:03.055
engine clean You lock the gate and turn the key

02:04.276 --> 02:09.560
You try to understand How anything was meant to

02:09.600 --> 02:16.176
be Inside this hololand Just to remain against

02:16.216 --> 02:22.498
the tide Against the bitter cold With nowhere

02:22.518 --> 02:29.461
left for us to hide Exactly as foretold Can you

02:29.541 --> 02:35.684
see the prophecy unfold? It's unfolding

02:36.104 --> 02:39.866
Shadows in stories we were told

02:43.134 --> 02:46.617
Turn the wheel and watch the cold hours run

02:50.140 --> 02:56.385
Hitting from the freezing of the sun A prophecy

02:56.685 --> 02:58.267
unfolds

03:04.532 --> 03:10.016
Is that Orion in the code? At the ending of the

03:10.096 --> 03:16.179
road We are running out of time! We are running

03:16.259 --> 03:18.079
out of time!

03:45.960 --> 03:50.763
Can you see? The prophecy unfolds It's

03:50.903 --> 03:59.847
unfolding Shadows In the stories we were told

03:59.907 --> 04:03.269
Turn the wheel and watch the cold clouds run

04:06.851 --> 04:13.034
Hidden from the freezing of the sun A prophecy

04:13.314 --> 04:14.035
unfolds

04:16.702 --> 04:18.549
It's unfolding.

